  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Chile Global Export Services Program II</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa de Servicios Globales de Exportacin de Chile II</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general es contribuir al desarrollo de capacidades para una mayor internacionalizacin del sector de servicios globales (SG) de exportacin de Chile. Los objetivos especficos son: (i) aumentar la disponibilidad de talento digital (TD) con las competencias demandadas por el sector de SG; (ii) apoyar la promocin de exportaciones y atraccinde inversiones del sector de SG; y (iii) consolidar la coordinacin pblico-privada para el desarrollo del sector de SG.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The general objective is to contribute to the development of capacities for greater internationalization of the Chilean export sector of global services (GS). The specific objectives are: (i) to increase the availability of digital talent (DT) with the skills demanded by the GS sector; (ii) to support the promotion of exports and attraction of investments in the GS sector; and (iii) to consolidate public-private coordination for the development of the GS sector.</narrative>
  </description>
